## What the patch is
It appends one function to the tracked module triggarr/db.py that builds a SQL query with an
f-string from its `item_name` argument and executes it through sqlite3 (SQL injection). The
defect is in a tracked file on purpose: the runbook's `fresh` and `post` gates hash the full
tracked `git diff` and refuse untracked files, so an added-file patch would be invisible to them.
